<title>UK: UK retail sales healthy - UK Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK retail sales healthy - UK Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said measuring the trend in retail sales by looking at the pre-Christmas December month alone was misleading, and the underlying longer term trend suggested healthy growth in retail sales with consumer spending expanding.</p>
<p>Data today showed a 0.8 percent fall in December sales but the three month versus previous three month measure rose 0.9 percent.</p>
</text>
